01:33:21.477 --> 01:33:23.706
I trained him.


01:33:23.745 --> 01:33:25.375
Okay, fine.


01:33:25.413 --> 01:33:28.944
You know, my last resident
gave me a Godiva Sampler


01:33:28.984 --> 01:33:30.443
when he finished his rotation.


01:33:31.619 --> 01:33:32.959
He was an underachiever.


01:33:32.987 --> 01:33:34.927
You really need
to open up a restaurant.


01:33:34.956 --> 01:33:37.685
No, he does not.
We need Dr. Rahimi


01:33:37.724 --> 01:33:38.724
right here.


01:33:40.093 --> 01:33:41.494
Thank you, Helen.


01:33:58.478 --> 01:34:00.118
Of course.


01:34:00.146 --> 01:34:03.016
He can cook,
he's a doctor. Keesha...


01:34:03.049 --> 01:34:05.118
What are you waiting for?


01:34:06.952 --> 01:34:08.382
You better call dibs.


01:34:11.323 --> 01:34:12.652
Here you go.
For the toast.


01:34:12.691 --> 01:34:13.951
Oh, for the toast.


01:34:13.992 --> 01:34:15.962
The toast.


01:34:15.994 --> 01:34:17.394
- Well...


01:34:19.730 --> 01:34:21.600
To Kayla.


01:34:22.266 --> 01:34:24.137
Going home for the New Year.


01:34:24.169 --> 01:34:25.878
To Kayla.
Miracles do happen.


01:34:25.903 --> 01:34:27.573
Kayla!


01:34:27.604 --> 01:34:30.374
Um, I hope you guys are
praying for a miracle tonight.


01:34:30.407 --> 01:34:33.076
Two hours before
the annual bloodbath


01:34:33.109 --> 01:34:34.209
begins anew.


01:34:34.243 --> 01:34:35.443
Oh. Oh, you hear that?


01:34:35.478 --> 01:34:37.579
Come on, boss.
Put that down.


01:34:37.614 --> 01:34:40.453
One last dance before
the madness begins.


01:34:50.693 --> 01:34:52.334
Right.


01:34:52.361 --> 01:34:53.760
Let me...
Let me show you.


01:34:56.965 --> 01:34:58.305
Helen.


01:34:59.134 --> 01:35:01.143
It's an honor
to be trained by you.


01:35:05.441 --> 01:35:06.671
My pleasure.


01:36:00.591 --> 01:36:01.762
Chef Reza!


01:36:05.863 --> 01:36:07.293
Oh, guys, it's almost time.


01:36:07.330 --> 01:36:08.939
Five minutes before midnight.


01:36:08.964 --> 01:36:09.994
Let's go, lets go.


01:36:10.033 --> 01:36:11.433
There she is.


01:36:11.467 --> 01:36:13.667
- We're going to miss it.
- No, you know what? Go ahead.


01:36:13.703 --> 01:36:16.673
I gotta get the hats
and the horns.


01:36:16.706 --> 01:36:18.276
- That's what...
- Hurry up!


01:36:18.307 --> 01:36:19.607
I am, I am, I am.


01:36:19.642 --> 01:36:21.202
Okay.


01:36:31.786 --> 01:36:35.356
So do you want
the big hat or the crown?


01:36:35.390 --> 01:36:37.749
Helen. Stay
a minute, please.


01:36:39.060 --> 01:36:41.330
- What's up?


01:36:43.230 --> 01:36:44.730
Don't go out there.


01:36:47.301 --> 01:36:49.131
Just go sit down.
Please. Helen.


01:36:49.169 --> 01:36:50.498
Helen!


01:36:51.304 --> 01:36:52.744
Helen, please!


01:39:25.280 --> 01:39:27.110
Mom, look, I'm doing it!

